    "reviews": "\u201c'Kuro Survival' is praised for its smooth mechanics, charming visuals, and engaging gameplay, though it faces criticism for its progression system, combat responsiveness, and visual quality. Players appreciate the emotional impact and challenge, but bugs, a lack of rewarding progression, and limited content variety may deter some. The game has potential, but balancing issues and technical glitches need to be addressed for a more satisfying experience.\u201d<br>87% \u2013 Niklas Notes<br><br>\u201cKuro Survival provides an enjoyable ninja gaming experience filled with action-packed battles, challenging boss fights, and a wide array of weapons at your disposal. Whether you're new to the ninja genre or a seasoned fan looking for your next adventure, this game is worth checking out!\u201d<br>??? \u2013 KeyHub<br>",
